': "TOTAL OF 27.5 MILLION DOSES ORDERED BY THE SWISS FEDERAL GOVERNMENT TO DATE CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 27, 2021 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE SWISS FEDERAL GOVERNMENT HAS EXERCISED ITS OPTION TO PURCHASE AN ADDITIONAL SEVEN MILLION DOSES OF MODERNA'S BOOSTER VACCINE FOR DELIVERY IN THE SECOND HALF OF 2022. THESE DOSES ARE IN ADDITION TO THE INITIAL SEVEN MILLION DOSES OF BOOSTER VACCINE THE SWISS FEDERAL GOVERNMENT AGREED TO PURCHASE FOR DELIVERY IN 2022 AND BRINGS SWITZERLAND'S ORDER COMMITMENT TO A TOTAL OF 27.5 MILLION DOSES."}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-12-27 16:35:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ ANNOUNCES MID-MONTH OPEN SHORT INTEREST POSITIONS IN NASDAQ STOCKS AS OF SETTLEMENT DATE DECEMBER 15, 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 27, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AT THE END OF THE SETTLEMENT DATE OF DECEMBER 15, 2021, SHORT INTEREST IN 3,103 NASDAQ GLOBAL MARKETSM SECURITIES TOTALED 8,912,688,445 SHARES COMPARED WITH 8,555,941,286 SHARES IN 3,036\xa0GLOBAL MARKET ISSUES REPORTED FOR THE PRIOR SETTLEMENT DATE OF NOVEMBER 30, 2021. THE MID-DECEMBER SHORT INTEREST REPRESENTS 2.40 DAYS COMPARED WITH 2.46 DAYS FOR THE PRIOR REPORTING PERIOD.'}{'symbol': 'NWS', 'date': '2021-12-27 08:00:00', 'title': 'NEWS CORP TO ACQUIRE BASE CHEMICALS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEWS CORP ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE BASE CHEMICALS BUSINESS FROM S&P GLOBAL AND IHS MARKIT. BASE CHEMICALS WILL BECOME PART OF DOW JONES' PROFESSIONAL INFORMATION BUSINESS, ALONGSIDE OPIS, THE ENERGY AND RENEWABLES DATA AND INFORMATION BUSINESS. THE OPIS ACQUISITION (ALONG WITH RELATED ASSETS), ALSO FROM S&P GLOBAL AND IHS MARKIT, WAS ANNOUNCED IN AUGUST. THE ADDITION OF BASE CHEMICALS AND OPIS WILL FURTHER ENHANCE DO"}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2021-12-25 08:23:00', 'title': 'JAMES WEBB SPACE TELESCOPE BEGINS MILLION-MILE JOURNEY', 'text': "KOURO